[{"client_msg_id":"bda9ede2-caa3-417d-9403-bc7a9746ae0d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"E315 は内部エラー(Vim 本体のバグ)なので、できることなら最小構成を作って本家にレポートできるといいんですけどねー","ts":"1628336712.005800","thread_ts":"1628287792.003900","subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["U01H161HVPS"]},{"name":"gativim","count":1,"users":["U01H161HVPS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=FQFf"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"3c7167bc-4fb7-4e30-b4ed-aab0b01e17f6","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"`:QuickRun` を特殊な条件下で実行すると内部エラー `E315: ml_get: invalid lnum: {number}` が出ることがあって、\nquickrun なしで再現したいと思ってるんですが、`:QuickRun` の処理を追いきれなくて中々難しい…","ts":"1628287792.003900","thread_ts":"1628287792.003900","edited":{"user":"U01H161HVPS","ts":"1628296080.000000"},"last_read":"1628336712.005800","subscribed":true,"reply_count":6,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n1w5"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"3c7167bc-4fb7-4e30-b4ed-aab0b01e17f6","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"`:QuickRun` を特殊な条件下で実行すると内部エラー `E315: ml_get: invalid lnum: {number}` が出ることがあって、\nquickrun なしで再現したいと思ってるんですが、`:QuickRun` の処理を追いきれなくて中々難しい…","ts":"1628287792.003900","thread_ts":"1628287792.003900","edited":{"user":"U01H161HVPS","ts":"1628296080.000000"},"last_read":"1628336712.005800","subscribed":true,"reply_count":6,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n1w5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dfa5ad7f-9f04-45bb-813e-f882d9b34ef4","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"私の環境だと、これで100％再現します：\n1. `vim -Nu NONE`\n2. これを `:source`：\n```call delete('/tmp/vim-quickrun', 'rf')\ncall system('git clone \u003chttps://github.com/thinca/vim-quickrun.git\u003e /tmp/vim-quickrun')\nset runtimepath^=/tmp/vim-quickrun\nruntime plugin/quickrun.vim\n\nset scrolloff=1\nset columns=80\n\ncall writefile([repeat('危険!', 500)], '/tmp/danger')\nedit /tmp/danger\nvsplit\nsplit \u003cquickrun://output\u003e\nclose\nQuickRun うわああああああああ```\n```Error detected while processing /private/tmp/e315.vim[14]..function quickrun#command#execute[13]../private/tmp/quickrun.vim[14]..function quickrun#command#execute[10]..quickrun#run[10]..103[9]..31[4]..\u0026lt;SNR\u0026gt;21_set_running_mark:\nline    4:\nE315: ml_get: invalid lnum: 2```","ts":"1628287926.004000","thread_ts":"1628287792.003900","edited":{"user":"U01H161HVPS","ts":"1628288782.000000"},"parent_user_id":"U01H161HVPS","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"duOK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a681ef0b-1b99-416b-8979-a72820e6f37b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"私の環境で試したところ、再現しませんでした。Vim のバージョンはいくつでしょう? 最新版でも再現します?","ts":"1628298075.004600","thread_ts":"1628287792.003900","parent_user_id":"U01H161HVPS","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/PH3e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"985fa113-8851-4553-a49c-1ecdadd0660d","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"Vim、quickrun ともに最新版でも再現しますー\n• quickrun.vim \u003chttps://github.com/thinca/vim-quickrun/commit/b39b1f6c69f7086e500ad7a6318c7bc97249b944|b39b1f6\u003e\n• Vim 8.2.3301\n• macOS Catalina (version 10.15.7)\n• iTerm2\nVimウィンドウのサイズが大きいと再現しなくなるので `set columns=80` してあるんですが、他にも依存する要素があるのかな…","ts":"1628312284.004900","thread_ts":"1628287792.003900","parent_user_id":"U01H161HVPS","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5LFA"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"こんな感じです。","ts":"1628313533.005100","thread_ts":"1628287792.003900","parent_user_id":"U01H161HVPS","files":[{"id":"F02B6S9H8TS","created":1628313474,"timestamp":1628313474,"name":"ss 2021-08-07 14.15.56.mov","title":"ss 2021-08-07 14.15.56.mov","mimetype":"video/quicktime","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"mov","pretty_type"